":"b-dda9a757fbdec515da88","layer":"original","quote":"权闻之，拊床起坐〖23〗，哀不能自止；数日减膳，言及流涕，使张承为作铭诔。二子烈、封，年各数岁；权内养于宫，爱待与诸子同。宾客进见，呼示之曰：“此吾虎子也！”及八九岁，令葛光教之读书，十日一令乘马","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":276,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":98,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chenghuang-q-6736a341652f903cca60","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-17881c810022ba5d250c","layer":"original","quote":"追录统功，封烈亭侯，还其故兵。后烈有罪免；封复袭爵，领兵","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":277,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
